OL,3,AFarage says #72m Reform donations legal
OL,4,A'today' as government seeks to change
OL,5,Alaw
OL,6,
OL,7,FReform UK leader Nigel Farage says two
OL,8,F#36m donations to the party, announced
OL,9,Fthis weekend, are legal "today"
OL,11,FThe government was already seeking to
OL,12,Fchange the law on party donations from
OL,13,FBritish expats, including a #100,000
OL,14,Fcap backdated to 25 March
OL,16,FAsked if the donations would still be
OL,17,Flegal if the law changed, Farage tells
OL,18,Four political editor Chris Mason:
OL,19,F"Retrospectively declaring donations
OL,20,Fillegal ` that simply cannot be"
OL,23,APub: 14-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
