OL,3,AFarage says #72m Reform donations legal
OL,4,A'today' as government seeks to change
OL,5,Alaw
OL,6,
OL,7,FOver the weekend, Reform announced #36m
OL,8,Fdonations from Christopher Harborne and
OL,9,FBen Delo, who both made money in
OL,10,Fcryptocurrency
OL,12,FReform's deputy leader Richard Tice
OL,13,Fsays his party is "merely trying to get
OL,14,Fon a level playing field" - BBC Verify
OL,15,Fhas looked at how much the Labour Party
OL,16,Freceives from trade unions
OL,18,FTUC boss Paul Nowak says the donations
OL,19,Fto Reform are a "crisis for our
OL,20,Fdemocracy"
